  "bodyHash": "PMgmPCwVZcI=",
  "content": "<h1>倒木 🪵</h1><p><strong>本模組</strong> 為 Minecraft 添加了 <strong>倒木</strong>，散佈於所有 <strong>擁有樹木的主世界生態域</strong>，為 <strong>原版遊戲</strong> 帶來更佳的場景 🗺️</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/735914b61f8ed176d628438bc1f6813b9dcada0b_0.webp\" alt=\"倒木\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp © - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>備註📝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>倒木</strong> 相容於版本 <strong>1.20 至 1.21.11</strong> 🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>倒木</strong> 在世界生成中添加新的原木 <strong>(結構)</strong> 🌐</li>\n<li><strong>倒木</strong> 與任何 <strong>世界生成模組</strong> 相容</li>\n<li><strong>無需</strong> 解壓縮下載的檔案 🗂️</li>\n<li>建議 <strong>使用耳機</strong> 以獲得 <strong>更佳體驗</strong> 🎧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>說明 🎼</h2><p>在原版 Minecraft 遊戲中享受更沉浸的體驗，<strong>我們新增了超過 8 種倒木 🪵，並附有變體</strong>，為每個主世界生態域帶來獨特且多樣的 <strong>特色</strong> 🌎。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5d4e02eaa351bac91c52f1385b002a7daca2a9b5.png\" alt=\"倒木宣傳\"></p>\n<p>有了這個 <strong>資料包</strong>，探索變得更加刺激，因為自然生成的倒木會出現在 <strong>不同的生態域中，從莽原、櫻花樹林、蒼白花園等等。🧭</strong></p>\n<h2>生成 🌐</h2><p><strong>每個生態域</strong> 都有其獨特的原木生成方式，取決於生態域的不同而有所差異。以下是每個生態域及其相應 <strong>倒木</strong>的範例：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>黑森林 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：7</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"黑橡木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b69599c711f6b89ade4217aa953941d190861f46.png\" alt=\"黑橡木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"黑橡木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>櫻花樹林 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"櫻花樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7470f9e6ef31832f71edec8cb21011d0d560bae5.png\" alt=\"櫻花原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"櫻花樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:cherry_grove\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>莽原 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"相思木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/617aa5fdf2ba29089198110438d6fd8c544bc2ef.png\" alt=\"相思木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"相思木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:savanna_plateau\",\n\"minecraft:savanna\",\n\"minecraft:windswept_savanna\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>蒼白花園 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9524f555fe5dbef01a0ce397246c00b5d87a4d.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49a573bb29b2b991aa9d47c4d00ab4b3e612260c.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9524f555fe5dbef01a0ce397246c00b5d87a4d.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:pale_garden\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>叢林 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：6</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b1aa9433f6c385506d287e16f362375a0c1d31.png\" alt=\"叢林樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8fe8b5f4574092ae9c6f22e4d816c7c2bd163036.png\" alt=\"叢林原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b1aa9433f6c385506d287e16f362375a0c1d31.png\" alt=\"叢林樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:bamboo_jungle\",\n\"minecraft:jungle\",\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>巨型杉木 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：6</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e854f3fdbf494018ea51d86262a8ada8fa77931e.png\" alt=\"杉木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf0400cb4fb58b661b6f811a93508386a24dedcc.png\" alt=\"杉木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e854f3fdbf494018ea51d86262a8ada8fa77931e.png\" alt=\"杉木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:old_growth_pine_taiga\",\n\"minecraft:old_growth_spruce_taiga\",\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>杜鵑 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：6</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/005307a32ef556a08001a7e866db2bdb636a9f1d.png\" alt=\"杜鵑樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/33bee147ea2c8d4c1f2ada693e583c01f573a81f.png\" alt=\"杜鵑原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/87facdc8b2cb2f760ec041046daa3d7106316d68.png\" alt=\"無花杜鵑樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:plains\",\n\"minecraft:forest\",\n\"minecraft:birch_forest\",\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\",\n\"minecraft:taiga\",\n\"minecraft:savanna\",\n\"minecraft:savanna_plateau\",\n\"minecraft:windswept_savanna\",\n\"minecraft:flower_forest\",\n\"minecraft:meadow\",\n\"minecraft:sparse_jungle\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>紅樹林 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：8</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cffdde27cab475339f2225353bac1455dc41c408.png\" alt=\"紅樹林木胎生苗物品\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e17bc2c9b7e87a73ed2ab2cfa4a41281e86209d2.png\" alt=\"紅樹林木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cffdde27cab475339f2225353bac1455dc41c408.png\" alt=\"紅樹林木胎生苗物品\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:mangrove_swamp\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>沼澤 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：8</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/137af9a144febf56dfaa30e5b0c85626c72ab551.png\" alt=\"沼澤原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:swamp\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>樺木 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：6</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891598a8447572b25572d29d96741faecd32ae40.png\" alt=\"樺木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab7a80c358f33103ea87f0ddc1f0af4b15dd7658.jpeg\" alt=\"樺木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891598a8447572b25572d29d96741faecd32ae40.png\" alt=\"樺木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:birch_forest\",\n\"minecraft:old_growth_birch_forest\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>橡木 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：6</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0318b5b27ffdb6cdef077c35f2705ef413100312.jpeg\" alt=\"橡木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:forest\",\n\"minecraft:meadow\",\n\"minecraft:sunflower_plains\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>沙漠 - 枯木</p>\n<h2>枯木變體數量：2</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e1d4584d5472b0eaf3ede0a8e6312f0921e856.png\" alt=\"枯灌木物品\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6bb9cc3009a4f80e2acda24b5b3d55ee3cf6fdb7.jpeg\" alt=\"沙漠枯木宣傳\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e1d4584d5472b0eaf3ede0a8e6312f0921e856.png\" alt=\"枯灌木物品\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:desert\",\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>杉木 - 倒木</p>\n<h2>倒木變體數量：8</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e854f3fdbf494018ea51d86262a8ada8fa77931e.png\" alt=\"杉木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2abc5908e8198912672eca2b3c2640a21bec66c.jpeg\" alt=\"杉木原木\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e854f3fdbf494018ea51d86262a8ada8fa77931e.png\" alt=\"杉木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:taiga\",\n\"minecraft:snowy_taiga\",\n\"minecraft:snowy_plains\",\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<h2>更多結構</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>露營商店</p>\n<h2>帳篷變體數量：2</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4339119b64f5d07aa6f82b67c4dd05679e486076.jpeg\" alt=\"帳篷宣傳\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:#is_forest\"\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>裝飾樹</p>\n<h2>裝飾樹變體數量：2</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc7ebd626b60200d01b7ebf66ee8fc54ed5677cd.jpeg\" alt=\"裝飾樹\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡木樹苗\"> <strong>生態域生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\"minecraft:forest\",\n\"minecraft:meadow\",\n],</code></pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新成就 🏆</h2><p>在主世界找到所有 <strong>倒木</strong> 變體將解鎖一個隱藏成就，名為 <strong>「幽靈伐木工」</strong>，顯示如下：</p>\n<p>◾ <strong>圖片 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d7ebd968518f7bf67ccd1b4a5145837cdb0a39db.png\" alt=\"鐵斧物品\">：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2e68f6b946bfd19ff7bf90ec1a6ef5049278597c.png\" alt=\"倒木成就\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e68050f8bae2255d74e6e8400d1c27b1b324e6eb.png\" alt=\"新倒木成就\"></p>",
